{"unit_id":"LoveIrishCoffee__dsh-effort-ultra#card-zh","repo":"LoveIrishCoffee/dsh-effort-ultra","commit":"c15df65c508f4fdc7d609b28dd2f9448da37b8cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-ultra 是面向 DSH Web composer 的原生模型与推理强度控件。它占用 composer 的模型选择座位，从官方会话目录读取模型及其声明的推理档位，并通过官方会话选择服务保存更改。用户可以搜索和切换模型、拖动滑条或从菜单选择档位，也能恢复模型默认值；界面会同步会话状态并适配明暗主题。适合希望在编辑提示时快速调整模型推理等级的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API Key 或第三方服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:865-945","lib/client.js:258-326","lib/client.js:640-706"]}
{"unit_id":"LoveIrishCoffee__dsh-effort-ultra#card-en","repo":"LoveIrishCoffee/dsh-effort-ultra","commit":"c15df65c508f4fdc7d609b28dd2f9448da37b8cb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-effort-ultra adds model and reasoning controls to the DSH web composer. It reads the official catalog and saves choices through the session service. Users can search models, select declared effort tiers, or restore defaults. The widget follows session state and supports light and dark themes.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:865-945","lib/client.js:258-326","lib/client.js:640-706"]}
